ample: What's the next step? What else should be paid attention to? Any other details?).\nReturn a JSON object containing a 'type' key: the value of the 'type' key is from 1 to 6, corresponding to the six different types of conversation purposes. The format should be as follows: { 'type': 1 to 6 }.\nReturn **only** a valid JSON object without any extra text.", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507', 'stream': False, 'temperature': 1e-05}}
